                                "sense_id": "3bf588f8-bc05-3c78-ae65-d64f369bf921",
                                "text": "Charing Cross station of the old South-Eastern Railway differed much in appearance from that of today, as it had an arched all-over roof, which collapsed some nine years later and was replaced by the present one."
